BT /F1 10 Tf 13 TL 50 740 Td
(Querying: Finding Relevant Passages) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(To answer a question, the system embeds the question with the same embedding model and) Tj T*
(searches the index for the nearest chunks. Plain similarity search can return several) Tj T*
(chunks that say nearly the same thing.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Maximal marginal relevance, or MMR, reduces that repetition. It first fetches a larger) Tj T*
(set of candidates, then picks results one at a time, balancing closeness to the question) Tj T*
(against similarity to the results it has already picked. A lambda value of 1 considers) Tj T*
(only closeness to the question, and lower values give more weight to variety.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
