(Generating and Checking the Answer) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The selected passages and the question are combined into a prompt, which instructs the) Tj T*
(model to answer from the passages and to say so when they don't contain the answer.) Tj T*
(Grounding like this reduces invented answers but doesn't eliminate them.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Showing the retrieved passages beside the answer lets a reader check the answer against) Tj T*
(its sources. A passage's distance score shows how similar it is to the question. It) Tj T*
(doesn't show that the passage is correct or that the answer used it faithfully. Reading) Tj T*
(the source remains the reliable way to verify a claim.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
